close_reason: "Merged in #65 (bb9d404). Native --limit + --output-limit continuations now resume after the last emitted row, mirroring upstream pm-cli#1420 (fixed in 2026.10.7). Orchestrator verification: the two new differential tests (combined_output_ceilings_replay_the_uncapped_snapshot, output_limit_producer_pages_are_complete_and_byte_identical) pass against the locked 2026.10.7 oracle and both fail with only src/read_output.rs reverted; just release-check passed (207 tests, all four 100% coverage gates)."
